
# basePath Chapter4

::FirstContractOpenCh4 
@trigger    OnContractSelectOpen
@cutscene
@once 

{@Dorian}   Hey, did you hear about the mine slowdowns at Kalvis?
{@Dorian}   Copper prices are through the roof!
{@Player}   Blaze says he's worried about safety. The mining bots keep breaking down.
{@Dorian}   Bro! Remember how overly cautious Blaze always was?
{@Player}   Yeah, he could be.
{@Dorian}   A few breakdowns aren't the end of the world. The bots are still saving them a fortune.
{@Dorian}   Anyway, I left you a sample of some gold. It might work as an alternative.
{@Player}   Imagine a world where gold is more affordable than copper!



//end call

::BeforeSupplyChainCh4
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Design)
@cutscene 
@once 

//quinn will introduce the idea that the hauling region you need is . She wants you to connect to callie to make sure she's willing to deal with you since you are frontier now. 

//incoming call from quinn
{@Quinn}    I know someone who can beat those Frosch boron prices. By a lot.
{@Quinn}    But working with Callie can be a little... risky.
{@Quinn}	... so, try not to offend her.

//end call

//call callie

{@Callie}   A'hoy! 
{@Callie}   Be blessed in my presence mere corpo-lackey! Or as I like to call ye, Clackey!
{@Callie}  	It is I, the Boron Space Pirate Queen of Velos Station! 
{@Player}  	Nice to meet you... Callie. 
{@Callie}   ...all ships with Frontier bots are marked for pillaging!
{@Callie}   Holler if you need some goods, Clacky. 
//end call

{@Player}  	Hey! I'm not a Clacky- aaaand she hung up. 



::AfterSupplyChainCh4 
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply)
@cutscene
@once 

{@Player} 	I was just looking at the photolithography equipment in the Fab bay. 
{@Player}	I noticed some glitches with the bots, P.A.L.
